Wonton POS database migrations

For a new database or existing Stage 7 database, run:
    flask --app run:app db upgrade

The baseline creates only missing tables and preserves existing tables/data.
For later schema changes:
    flask --app run:app db migrate -m "describe schema change"
    flask --app run:app db upgrade

Review generated migrations and back up production before applying them.
Never use db.drop_all() on production.
